          "value": "<p>When the majungasaurus rolls initiative using Stealth (or a player respawns into this dino), it can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.2u915NdUyQan6uKF]{Demoralize} each enemy within @Template[emanation|distance:300]{300 feet} as a free action. Regardless of the effect, each creature is then temporarily immune to Startling Roar for 1 hour. <br />This only will work if the player roars like a dino.</p>"
